<!DOCTYPE html>
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<title>Font hinting parity: Noto, DejaVu, Liberation</title>
<style type="text/css">
body { font-size: 24px; margin: 8px; }
p { margin: 0 0 4px 0; }
.noto { font-family: "Noto Sans"; }
.dejavu { font-family: "DejaVu Sans"; }
.liber { font-family: "Liberation Sans"; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<p class="noto">Noto: Decrease boxes 13 C sx</p>
<p class="dejavu">DejaVu: Decrease boxes 13 C sx</p>
<p class="liber">Liberation: Decrease boxes 13 C sx</p>
</body>
</html>
